{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"why\": \"解释成立。H2已建立亲近中的欢喜与酸涩，H3进一步建立了亲近带来的真实欢喜，以及他正在享受靠近本身。S04-B4中，美好与亲近仍在持续，左手水波却不断向前，形成‘越觉得此刻美好，越舍不得它过去’的具体依据；S04-B1中歌声变得更迫切、反复铺陈，S04-B3中不自觉地握紧，也支持这种舍不得转化为急切。解释由已建立的欢喜出发，以不愿美好时刻流逝说明急切为何出现，提供了原因与后果，而不只是重述听感，也没有编造失去的具体事件。\",\n  \"coverage_gaps\": [\n    \"S04-B1：歌声像讲往事般反复折回、不断补充细节的情绪失控感，尚未得到充分解释。\",\n    \"S04-B2：情意冲向顶点时的颤抖、哽咽，以及情绪仿佛完全打开却又退弱、无法稳稳落下的变化，尚未解释。\",\n    \"S04-B3：越想用力抓牢当下，反而越使平衡变得脆弱的矛盾感，尚未解释。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2a181d93-e148-4e4b-9817-b3c37450ed15", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045602837621Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.469, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:56:23.307547+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bf9ef9874b695094d56cb5b3269174fb7d2e6c112e6b39d254d2f1123ae1f9f1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch